---
// Portada «B2» de /omnicanal, /agentes y cada agente: el texto de la página a la izquierda
// y la escena de Lucía con los tres agentes a la derecha (isla React que se activa al verse).
import { ctaOf } from "../../lib/site"
const cta = ctaOf(Astro.locals.pricing)
import AgentScene, { type AgentFocus } from "./AgentScene"

interface Props {
  tag: string
  title: string
  accent: string
  /** Color del final del título: el del agente al frente o el celeste de la marca. */
  accentColor?: string
  /** Por qué el agente se llama así (solo en la página de cada agente). */
  meaning?: string
  lead: string
  focus?: AgentFocus
}
const { tag, title, accent, accentColor = "var(--sky-2)", meaning, lead, focus = "todos" } = Astro.props
---
<section class="hero ah">
  <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="ah-copy wrap">
    <div class="ah-col">
      <span class="tag tag-d rise">[ {tag} ]</span>
      <h1 class="ah-h1 rise d1">{title} <span style={`color: ${accentColor}`}>{accent}</span></h1>
      {meaning && <p class="ah-meaning rise d2" style={`--mc: ${accentColor}`}>{meaning}</p>}
      <p class="lead lead-d rise d2">{lead}</p>
      <div class="ah-ctas rise d3">
        <a class="btn btn-p" href={cta.href}>{cta.label}</a>
        <a class="btn btn-g" href="/precios">Ver los precios</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="ah-scene">
    <AgentScene client:visible focus={focus} />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ah { min-height: 860px; padding: 0 0 40px; }
  .ah-copy { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding-top: 188px; pointer-events: none; }
  .ah-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 26px; width: min(560px, 44vw); pointer-events: auto; }
  .ah-h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 4.1vw, 60px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.045em; font-weight: 800; text-wrap: balance; }
  .ah-col .lead { max-width: 540px; }
  .ah-meaning { max-width: 540px; margin: -8px 0 0; padding-left: 14px; border-left: 2px solid var(--mc); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; font-style: italic; color: #cfe2e7; }
  .ah-ctas { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .ah-scene { position: absolute; z-index: 1; top: 96px; right: 0; width: min(800px, calc(100% - 640px)); }

  /* La escena del tablero, escalada desde 800 × 680 al ancho disponible. */
  .ah :global(.b2) { --s: 1; }
  .ah :global(.b2-fit) { position: relative; width: 100%; height: calc(680px * var(--s)); overflow: hidden; }
  .ah :global(.b2-stage) { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 800px; height: 680px; transform: scale(var(--s)); transform-origin: 0 0; }
  .ah :global(.b2-canvas) { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .ah :global(.b2-ch) { position: absolute; left: 12px; height: 36px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 999px; font-family: var(--agent-font); font-size: 12.5px; color: #cfe7ec; background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.12); transition: background-color .5s ease, color .5s ease, box-shadow .5s ease, opacity .5s ease; }
  .ah :global(.b2-ch.on) { background: rgba(255,255,255,.14); color: #fff; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--c); }
  .ah :global(.b2-ch.dim) { opacity: .35; }
  .ah :global(.b2-name) { position: absolute; left: 330px; top: 360px; width: 280px; display: flex; justify-content: center; font-size: 17px; }
  .ah :global(.b2-hist) { position: absolute; left: 290px; top: 404px; width: 360px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(8,26,32,.88); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.1); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .ah :global(.b2-hk) { font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9fb8bf; }
  .ah :global(.b2-hr) { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 10px 1fr auto; gap: 10px; align-items: center; font-size: 13.5px; color: #cfe2e7; }
  .ah :global(.b2-hr i) { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--c); }
  .ah :global(.b2-hr.first) { color: #fff; animation: b2pop .45s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both; }
  .ah :global(.b2-tm) { font-size: 11.5px; color: #9fb8bf; }
  .ah :global(.b2-in) { position: absolute; left: 24px; right: 24px; top: 540px; }
  .ah :global(.b2-out) { display: none; }
  .ah :global(.b2-agents) { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
  .ah :global(.b2-ag) { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; text-align: left; padding: 14px 16px; min-height: 118px; border-radius: 18px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font); color: #cfe2e7; background: rgba(10,33,41,.72); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.1); transition: transform .45s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), background-color .45s ease, box-shadow .45s ease, opacity .45s ease; }
  .ah :global(.b2-ag:hover) { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.3); }
  .ah :global(.b2-ag.on) { transform: translateY(-8px); background: rgba(10,33,41,.95); color: #fff; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--c), 0 18px 40px -18px var(--c); }
  .ah :global(.b2-ag.dim) { opacity: .45; }
  .ah :global(.b2-ag .nm) { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.5px; color: #fff; }
  .ah :global(.b2-ag .nm > span:first-child) { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .ah :global(.b2-ag .nm i) { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--c); flex: none; }
  .ah :global(.b2-ag .pin) { font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 500; font-size: 11px; color: #9fb8bf; }
  .ah :global(.b2-ag .sub) { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px; color: #9fb8bf; }
  .ah :global(.b2-ag .tx) { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; }
  .ah :global(.b2-foot) { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; padding: 4px 32px 0 120px; }
  .ah :global(.b2-cap) { flex: 1 1 auto; }
  .ah :global(.b2-cap) { font-size: 15px; color: #9fb8bf; }
  .ah :global(.b2-btns) { flex: none; display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: flex-end; }
  @keyframes b2pop { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }

  /* Ventanas medianas: el texto arriba y la escena debajo, a lo ancho. */
  @media (max-width: 1080px) {
    .ah { min-height: 0; }
    .ah-copy { padding-top: 120px; }
    .ah-col { width: 100%; max-width: 640px; }
    .ah-scene { position: relative; top: auto; right: auto; width: min(800px, 100%); margin: 32px auto 0; }
    .ah :global(.b2) { --s: .9; }
    .ah :global(.b2-foot) { padding: 4px 32px 0; }
  }
  /* Teléfono: la escena sin las tarjetas, y las tarjetas de los agentes debajo, una por fila. */
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .ah-copy { padding-top: 104px; }
    .ah-ctas .btn { flex: 1 1 100%; }
    .ah-scene { margin-top: 16px; }
    .ah :global(.b2) { --s: .47; }
    .ah :global(.b2-fit) { height: calc(560px * var(--s)); }
    .ah :global(.b2-in) { display: none; }
    .ah :global(.b2-out) { display: block; padding: 8px 16px 0; }
    .ah :global(.b2-agents) { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; }
    .ah :global(.b2-ag) { min-height: 0; }
    .ah :global(.b2-ag.on) { transform: none; }
    .ah :global(.b2-foot) { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; padding: 16px 16px 0; }
    .ah :global(.b2-btns) { justify-content: stretch; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .ah :global(.b2-btns .pill) { flex: 1 1 auto; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ah :global(.b2 *) { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
  }
</style>
